# Clockwork Percussionist: "You may play it until the end of your next turn." The Forest exiled when the Percussionist died on turn 1
# may be played through turn 3 (the scenario in which Bot1 plays it then is its control) - here Bot1 plays an Island from its hand
# on turn 3 instead and the permission ends with that turn's cleanup step (CR 514.2). On turn 5, with its land drop open
# (the Island from hand is played right after as the control), Bot1 may no longer play the Forest from exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Clockwork Percussionist
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Island
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clockwork Percussionist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Clockwork Percussionist)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Forest
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Exile.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Exile = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Mox Ruby; Island; Island
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island
